<p>I do like the object. There are some iffy tonal things going on (&quot;Hostilities commenced, containment was breached&quot; could be replaced with something like &quot;The hostile forces initiated an attack against Foundation personnel; containment on SCP-1275 was breached shortly thereafter&quot;; while obviously more verbose, it's also more clinical, whereas the current phrasing is&#8230;bored-sounding, I guess? As if the paragraph is just rattling through plot points before getting to the good stuff.), but it's a good object. No vote for just little things I can't fully put my finger on. It almost seems, weird though it sounds, like this is the X-man of transdimensional metallic goop. It's just a little too powerful to not be able to, say, send itself through itself.</p>
<p>Nice slipping in the CI tag, though. :)</p>

